// Comments on required native constraints and rewrites:
//
// Native Constraints (implement in C++):
// - isConnectedSubgraph: Verifies ops form expected connectivity pattern
// - isSplatConstant: Checks if constant is a splat value
// - isLinearChain: Verifies operations form a linear dependency chain
//
// Native Rewrites (implement in C++):  
// - getExternalInputs: Find values flowing into subgraph from outside
// - getExternalOutputs: Find values flowing out of subgraph
// - generateUniqueFuncName: Create unique name for extracted function
// - getValueTypes: Extract types from value range
// - createFunctionType: Build function type from input/output types
// - createFunctionArguments: Create block arguments for new function
// - cloneOperationsToFunction: Clone ops, remap values, handle constants
// - getClonedOutputs: Map original outputs to cloned equivalents
// - replaceUsesWithCallResults: Update uses to use call results
// - eraseOperations: Clean up original operations